After Wednesday's event, Apple let members of the media take a look at the new <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-18-pro/">iPhone 18 Pro</a> models, so we're able to share some early first impressions with you before pre-orders start tomorrow.<br/>
<br/>
